{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2329dc277c2a69b76ad6fdb49e61ad6bbf332b546096430e6cf2bb719c0df746","ja":"うっ……すみません、お腹がパンパンです。\nもうこれ以上は……。","zh":"唔……对不起，肚子已经撑得不行了。\n实在吃不下了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d8e3be5abea696800ca2fd004e5dff2b6854244019e6f1cab02ec1e75ebfdec1","ja":"瑞希、あともう少しです。先にりたいあした\n桃子の分まで頑張りましょう！","zh":"瑞希，还差一点点了。先回去的桃子\n的那一份，我们也一起努力吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"72d96909af437bfc66ef6b32fec8e76ea811d991b6e1a3099e5c4947bc4995da","ja":"ど、どうして、貴音さんは平気なのでしょう……？\n私よりずっとたくさん味見をしているのに……ガクッ。","zh":"怎、怎么会，贵音女士为什么会没事呢……？\n明明试吃的量比我还要多得多……（倒地）。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"55536e3dc15f577ac07b9e82c14a03cfa68881344d9b6e2593db10b41839fb54","ja":"どうして、と言われましても平気としか……。\nあっ、瑞希……しっかりしてください、瑞希！","zh":"就算您问我为什么，我也只能回答没事……\n啊，瑞希……振作一点，瑞希！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"22eaa3046765fa90a47055a130c7f9255fe6f81dd2c0966a3d1fc6f24017ff95","ja":"貴音さん、どうしたの……って、\nええっ！　瑞希さん、大丈夫！？","zh":"贵音，你怎么了……等等，\n诶诶！瑞希，你没事吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2a8643f929dbf9bb0baae05bf49504fc7f3e831277427b377485a14330d1432c","ja":"育、来てくれたのですね。実は瑞希は、お鍋のお出汁を\n飲みすぎて体調を崩してしまったのです。","zh":"育，你来了呀。其实瑞希是因为喝了\n太多火锅高汤，导致身体不舒服了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6e5129f1b9fcedc63a9e0f661155f473c71658855f2f8784aa13139bdbeeca81","ja":"え～っと……どうしてそんなにお出汁を飲んだの？","zh":"那个……你为什么喝了那么多高汤呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b125ce02697fbc7946368933416fdd05ea52a4590661a0934af487af65a97d1c","ja":"このみがろけ地で食べた鍋をまた食べたいらしく、\nそれなら、私達で再現しようと。","zh":"这个美好像很想再吃一次在外景地吃过的火锅，\n于是我们便想着把它还原出来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"eaae2b98fe4fc99440a384d784ffb3ce1d72430f9f166c4f0dd65af6f59d22bb","ja":"隠し味のおおよその特定はできたのですが、\nまだ、何かが足りないようで……。","zh":"虽然大致确定了独门配料，\n但似乎还缺了点什么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7b72e0ba8bee12e9951b1296627b5f7d05a63b4760907b85e7af55698ccc9ad0","ja":"あ、それならわたし知ってるよ！\n作ってるところ、見せてもらったんだ♪","zh":"啊，那个我知道哦！\n有人带我看过制作过程呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5197b81a3f0bc639fb1ead5943bdae21fda02db7c0718c9e77591f9867e1cf56","ja":"なんと……！　真ですか、育！","zh":"竟然……！是真的吗，育！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0f1e2d579050cd10c64f8da5cda44b3e796569b6053b55dd514b230d183d170b","ja":"うん！　隠し味を入れるタイミングと量が\n大切なんだって。","zh":"嗯！听说加入秘方调料的时机和分量\n非常关键。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4702fc8761b79010ae62f1f5789fb927b2d0c1763dc0ac3dd5ff9f043ee50195","ja":"そうだったのですね。\n育のおかげで、完成が見えて参りました。","zh":"原来是这样啊。\n多亏了育，已经能看到完成的眉目了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1309.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"81e877be80774f3e09db060db620589783c2fb808c8ad57430cefa06841bb0cb","ja":"待っていてください、このみ……。\n皆で作ったお鍋、必ずや味わっていただきます！","zh":"请等一等，木实……。\n大家一起做的火锅，必定会让您品尝到的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
